 ('20+ samples', 'we bring to your door, including the dense stair-grade nylons most showrooms keep in the back. The bend test happens on your own staircase, in your own light.'),
 ('From $1.49/sq ft', 'where installed carpet starts with us, pad and labor included. Stairs add their per-tread labor on top &mdash; and we put that number in writing the same visit we measure.'),
